# Cross-port fixtures are compared byte-for-byte (a formatter's output
# against its .expected.pxf, a decode → encode round trip against the
# fixture body). Git's CRLF conversion on Windows checkouts turned every
# LF into CRLF and failed those comparisons on the windows-latest leg, so
# the fixture and schema files are pinned to LF on every platform.
*.pxf   text eol=lf
*.proto text eol=lf
*.hex   text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
